{title: Tum Aaye To ( Aur Kya )}
{artist: Abhijeet Jatin Lalit Phir Bhi Dil Hai Hindustani}
{key: A#}

{c: Verse 1}
[A#]Tum aaye [D#]to hawao mein [F]ek nasha hai
[A#]Tum aaye [D#]to fijao mein [Cm]rang sa hai
[F]Yeh rang [Cm]saare hai [F]bas tumhaare
[A#]Aur kya, [F]aur kya, [A#]aur kya
[D#]Tum [A#]aaye ho [D#]toh yeh [A#]dekh lo,
[D#]naya naya [F]sa lage [A#]yeh jaha ho
[F]Haan haan haan [A#]haan haan oh ho
[D#]Hansi [A#]hansi [D#]hai [A#]yeh jamin,
[D#]dhula dhula [F]sa hai [A#]yeh aasmaan
[A#]Tum ho to [F]hai yeh sama
[A#]Aur kya, [F]aur kya, [A#]aur kya
[D#]Dhadak [A#]raha [D#]hai [A#]dil mera,
[D#]jhuki jhuki [F]hai palke [A#]yaha ho
[F]Haan haan haan [A#]haan haan oh ho
[D#]Jo dil [A#]mein ho [D#]woh kah [A#]bhi do,
[D#]ruki ruki [F]si hai [A#]yeh daastan
[A#]Jasbat [F]maange jaban
[A#]Aur kya, [F]aur kya, aur [A#]kya, aur kya
